<title>USA: Old National files shelf for $150 mln.</title>
<headline>Old National files shelf for $150 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old National Bancorp filed Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $150 million in medium-term notes.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used for repayment of debt, investments in and advances to the subsidiaries of the Evansville, Ind.,-based company, company stock repurchases by the company and other general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
